==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|childer}}, {{m|enm|childre}}, from {{inh|en|ang|ċildra}}, {{m|ang|ċildru}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈt͡ʃɪldə(ɹ)/}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-childer.wav|a=Southern England}}

